# Requests go to the same origin as the page. In development the Vite dev server proxies /api and
# /hubs to http://127.0.0.1:5080; in production the built frontend is served from the server's own
# wwwroot, so there is nothing to point at. Leave this empty unless the server is somewhere else.
VITE_API_BASE=

# Mocks are off unless this is exactly "true". Turn them on to work on screens with no server
# running: an in-memory dataset stands in, including a simulated translation run over SignalR,
# without which the behaviour that matters most — chapters becoming readable one at a time — has
# nothing to show.
VITE_USE_MOCKS=
